## Validasi sampel: total net harian dihitung ulang langsung dari raw.orders (harus sama dengan mart)

```sql
SELECT a.order_date, round(a.net_amount_all_status,2) AS mart, round(sum(o.net_amount),2) AS dari_raw FROM marts.agg_daily_sales a JOIN raw.orders o ON cast(o.order_ts AS date)=a.order_date GROUP BY a.order_date, a.net_amount_all_status ORDER BY a.order_date LIMIT 3
```

| order_date          |   mart |   dari_raw |
|:--------------------|-------:|-----------:|
| 2026-09-01 00:00:00 | 363.57 |     363.57 |
| 2026-09-02 00:00:00 | 258.82 |     258.82 |
| 2026-09-03 00:00:00 | 584.05 |     584.05 |



